WEBVTT

00:07:59.860 --> 00:08:01.789
Creating open channels of communication

00:08:01.813 --> 00:08:04.236
is even more important in virtual teams.

00:08:04.260 --> 00:08:08.047
You've probably had video calls
that were dominated by one talking head,

00:08:08.071 --> 00:08:10.046
but that's only the tip of the iceberg.

00:08:10.070 --> 00:08:12.096
MH: So the less obvious things,

00:08:12.120 --> 00:08:15.169
there are two big buckets of things

00:08:15.193 --> 00:08:17.776
called "shared identity" problems

00:08:17.800 --> 00:08:20.309
and "shared understanding" problems.

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:23.825
AG: Shared identity
and shared understanding.

00:08:24.374 --> 00:08:27.127
Beneath the everyday communication
challenges you've seen,

00:08:27.151 --> 00:08:29.401
these are probably
the bigger issues at play.